# Environment variables for Fauxdoo on Webflow Cloud.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH (not secret): the app's mount path, e.g. /savings.
#   - Production: add it in Webflow Cloud > Environment Variables. Webflow Cloud
#     sets Next.js basePath automatically but not this variable, which browser
#     code needs for fetch() and plain <img>. Update it when the mount path
#     changes, then push to redeploy.
#   - Local: leave it unset (the app runs at /).
#
# ADMIN_TOKEN (secret): bearer token for /api/admin/* routes.
#   - Production: add it in Webflow Cloud > Environment Variables, marked as Secret.
#   - Local: put it in .dev.vars (see .dev.vars.example), not in .env files.
